1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,220
I'm just going to say this.

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:07,620
Solidarity requires folks to stand and see each other and each other's fight.

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:16,560
It also requires folks to not only stand and see each other, but to see each other in who you choose to also stand with.

4
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:43,200
I have been seeing a number of platforms that are platforming individuals who have been notoriously, boldly and consistently anti-Black, who have espoused racist rhetoric as the means for their own livelihood and continue to push this in a way that is incredibly deleterious to the welfare of Black people here in America and the diaspora.

5
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:52,000
You cannot stand in solidarity by platforming those people simply because at this moment they are saying something that aligns with your cause.

6
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,700
So let's check that.

